pt-when is dual-platform by construction: every measurement runs on\nWindows (CPython 3.12.2, jsonschema 4.23.0) AND WSL Ubuntu 24.04\n(CPython 3.12.3, jsonschema 4.10.3), and both must be green — including\nthe guard-versus-Draft202012Validator cross-check, which is a real\npass/fail on both platforms (N2-R2). A gap on either platform is a stop.\n\n**First same-repository Slice.** Phase and Slice both live in the\ncontrol repository — a configuration no gate contract has been exercised\nin. Any contract clause that cannot be satisfied as written in this\nconfiguration is a STOP and a finding under ADR-0032's first reopening\ncondition, never an improvisation.\n\n**The corpus is out of scope.** Corpus v1.1 is frozen; `fixtures/` and\n`schema/` are outside the allowlist, and any needed change there is an\napproved N1 correct-course, not Slice work.\n\n`depends_on` is empty: P2-S1 consumes corpus v1.1 from the base commit\nof its own branch, not from any Slice's released output, and the control\nrepository's issues carry no dependency edges (measured, N2-G0R).\n\n## gatebraid-metadata\n\n```yaml\nschema: gatebraid/slice@1\nslice_id: P2-S1\nstage: S2\nphase: P2\nworkflow_profile: classic\nenvironment: mixed-see-prose\nrisk: low\ndepends_on: []\nwrite_domains: [\"bin/\", \"docs/evidence/gatebraid/P2-S1/\"]\nresource_locks: []\nrepair_limit: 2\nconsult_first: false\nparallel_mode: safe-single-writer\n```\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MianliWang/gatebraid/issues/8/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MianliWang/gatebraid/issues/8/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MianliWang/gatebraid/issues/10","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MianliWang/gatebraid","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MianliWang/gatebraid/issues/10/labels{/na