}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MianliWang/gatebraid/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MianliWang/gatebraid/deployments","created_at":"2026-07-29T05:07:17Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T21:02:09Z","pushed_at":"2026-08-25T21:01:01Z","git_url":"git://github.com/MianliWang/gatebraid.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:MianliWang/gatebraid.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/MianliWang/gatebraid.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/MianliWang/gatebraid","homepage":null,"size":1490,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":5,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":5,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"# P2-S2 — the independent evidence validator (N3)\n\n## Goal\n\nLand M3's independent evidence validator: the tool that re-derives verdicts\nfrom captured evidence JSON and the frozen schemas alone, publishes a\n`gatebraid/coverage-report@1` classifying every verified property, and kills\nthe N1 corpus mutations independently of the generator (M3-PLAN §2 N3;\nADR-0031 N3-start freeze; ADR-0032 decisions 1 and 5). The script's official\nname is ratified per ADR-0030 in this Slice's State Packet Approval, not\nassumed here.\n\n## Context\n\n- Why now: N2 (P2-S1, #8) is landed and closed; the N2/N3 bootstrap boundary\n  expires at N2 + N3 Gate 3 completion, and N3 re-validates N2's\n  bootstrap-marked records after its own Gate 3.\n- Independence: authored without reading N2's implementation — the authoring\n  session receives the frozen schemas and the N1 corpus only; the\n  imports-and-authorship independence review is performed by the coordinator\n  from the record before freeze (M3-PLAN §2 N3).\n- Non-goals: no change to any N2 file; no corpus change (IN-01 is\n  re-assigned to corpus v2 at P); no O0 material; no contract, schema, ADR\n  or template edit.\n- Related: Stage S2 `#6` · Phase P2 `#7` · P2-S1 `#8` ·\n  `schema/coverage-report.schema.json` · ADR-0028 / ADR-0030 / ADR-0031 /\n  ADR-0032.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- [ ] M3-PLAN §2 N3 Accept-when, in full: all applicable N1 mutations killed\n      independently of N2; a deliberately corrupted N2 output rejected;\n      dual-platform; the independence review (imports and authorship) on\n      record; the coverage report classifies every verified property as\n      `structural`, `semantic`, `replayed`, or `capture-trusted` with no\n      unlabelled `replayable` credit; landed once through its own gate;\n      frozen at delivery.\n- [ ] Every record this Slice produces validates against the frozen\n      interfaces, loader named, as part of its own evidence.\n\n## Gate evidence\n\n<!-- Filled as gates complete: docs/evidence/gatebraid/P2-S2/ -->\n\n## gatebraid-metadata\n\n```yaml\nschema: gatebraid/slice@1\nslice_id: P2-S2\nstage: S2\nphase: P2\nworkflow_profile: classic\nenvironment: mixed-see-prose\nrisk: low\ndepends_on: []\nwrite_domains:\n  - bin/gatebraid-validate.py\n  - bin/gatebraid-validate-selftest.py\n  - docs/evidence/gatebraid/P2-S2/\nresource_locks: []\nrepair_limit: 2\nconsult_first: false\nparallel_mode: safe-single-writer\n```\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MianliWang/gatebraid/issues/10/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MianliWang/gatebraid/issues/10/timeline","performe